From 60d9d4e5ab28d7e9178fa23bdbf52af058f8c3eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James Dumay <james@generalinference.xyz>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 22:32:01 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add bounded Turbo4 KV support to Skippy CPU and Metal

Extract the rotated V codec, CPU reference transform and qualified Metal kernels without changing the upstream source pin or existing cache serialization. Reject unsupported cache layouts and placements.

Validation: source review and git diff --check only; native build and runtime qualification must run through JY.

Assisted-by: Codex
